   198	def _tick_row_hash(row: tuple) -> str:
   199	    """Era-aware identity hash — what the successor's prev_hash commits to.
   200	
   201	    Includes the signature key only when the row carries one, so every
   202	    pre-signature row (and every pre-chain row) hashes byte-identically to
   203	    delta 1 — no re-anchoring. For signed rows the successor chains over
   204	    content+signature, making signature-stripping a detectable break
   205	    (design/tick-signature-in-chain-envelope).
