   536	
   537	        The write's OWN result satisfies the write-receipt attestation
   538	        contract (LIBS_CHANGES P1 — "the committed row, or the write
   539	        operation's actual result"): this method assembled the exact row it
   540	        inserted, so the signature it hands back IS the committed column,
   541	        with no read-back SELECT. ``signature_override`` flows through
   542	        verbatim. :meth:`fact_signature` remains the public read-back API
   543	        for cross-checks.
