   662	            f"log accounts for {expect_facts}/{expect_ticks}. "
   663	            "Out-of-band writers (store.merge, store.receive, rebirth, "
   664	            "compact) are not wired for a JSONL-canonical store. Recovery: "
   665	            "open it as a plain SqliteStore and re-export the log "
